{"pageProps":{"title":"Git、Githubとは ","visibility":["基礎班","発展班"],"mdBlocks":[{"blockId":"26aa501ef337814094bbf5d72f6b3c6c","type":"paragraph","parent":{"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"ここでは「そもそもGit、GitHubとは何？」について説明します。","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}]}},"children":[]},{"blockId":"26aa501ef337815cb943efffd62b35af","type":"paragraph","parent":{"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"GitとGitHubは、どちらもソフトウェア開発の際に利用されるツールですが、それぞれ異なる役割を持っています。","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}]}},"children":[]},{"blockId":"26aa501ef33781e3b28dd464fc5ec2a2","type":"heading_2","parent":{"type":"header","header":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"概要","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}],"is_toggleable":false}},"children":[]},{"blockId":"26aa501ef33781d080f5e37e02848072","type":"divider","parent":{"type":"none"},"children":[]},{"blockId":"26aa501ef337810ab20de3d6848c16a9","type":"paragraph","parent":{"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"GitとGitHubは、ソフトウェア開発で広く使われているバージョン管理システムです。開発者がコードを管理し、複数の人が同時に協力してプロジェクトを進めるために使われます。変更履歴を保存し、過去のバージョンに戻したり、ブランチを作成して異なる開発ラインを並行して進めることができるため、特にチーム開発に非常に役立ちます。","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}]}},"children":[]},{"blockId":"26aa501ef3378107ac29d981308046ef","type":"paragraph","parent":{"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"以下ではGitとGitHubそれぞれに